<title>HONG KONG: Korean Air details July/Aug cargo traffic.</title>
<headline>Korean Air details July/Aug cargo traffic.</headline>
<byline>Jim Gilchrist</byline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korean Air Ltd (KAL) said there was an 8.4 percent rise in the amount of cargo by weight on both domestic and international flights during July compared with the same month last year and in August there was a 6.3 percent increase.</p>
<p>However there was a 2.6 percent drop in July's cargo load factor and a 2.4 percent fall during August, the KAL statistics show.</p>
