<p>KAL's statistics also show a 9.6 percent rise in the number of international and domestic passengers carried 1.341.400 this year from 1,224,200 last July. In August there was a nine percent increase to 1,580,000 from 1,439,200.</p>
<p>AFTK &amp; FTK unit: 1,000,000 ton.km. Cargo weight unit:1,000 ton.</p>
